From a6c10c92ce76a899c8a6ce42a4ad05ff140e1121 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 09:22:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] WIP: F-219 - combat module, auras, self/inventory/use_item,
 start-area runner

- zeppelin/modules/combat: kill (approach/face/swing/abilities, swing-error handling,
  'no damage' give-up for friendly/immune targets, corpse loot), rest (sit until %),
  revive (repop with its read_skip<uint8> byte, MSG_CORPSE_QUERY for a corpse from an
  earlier session, ghost run, reclaim delay), state (attackers)
- move: face; speed-change acks held until our position is known (an ack before
  SMSG_LOGIN_VERIFY_WORLD moved a ghost to 0,0,0 - HandleForceSpeedChangeAck applies it)
- wow: SMSG_MONSTER_MOVE parsed to destination+duration, positions interpolated (stale
  start points made melee chase the wrong spot); unit auras from SMSG_AURA_UPDATE(_ALL);
  self state (health, power, level, xp, money, ghost) and bag inventory
- interact: find guid/has_aura, self, inventory, use_item (CMSG_USE_ITEM), update capture
  (ZEP_CAPTURE_DIR) + zeppelin/tools/updump
- tests/start_area.py: data-driven quest runner (starters/enders/objectives/loot sources
  /spell target-aura conditions from the world DB); Valley of Trials orc warrior: all 10
  quests rewarded (DB-confirmed), RESULT PASS

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SQmFdwZBdZ1kNkYTTF4JNJ
